cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "BuildingEnergyGraphs"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for constructing and comparing building energy graph
  representations (zone/component granularity, heterogeneous/homogeneous
  structure, three weather-attachment variants) and for training graph neural
  networks on them for building energy prediction.
type: software
